{"id":1757450,"retrievedAt":"2026-08-28T21:38:25.734Z","response":{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":null,"belongs_to_collection":null,"budget":0,"genres":[{"id":99,"name":"Documentary"}],"homepage":"","id":1757450,"imdb_id":"tt2042586","origin_country":["GB"],"original_language":"en","original_title":"Lake Brienze and Geissbach Falls","overview":"This gives a panorama of the Village of Isebwald and entrance to Interlaken from the deck of a steamer on Lake Brienz. The famous Geissbach falls form a charming back ground, while as the steamer passes by close to the falls a superb picture of these has been obtained by the use of the Rotary-Maxim Bioscope. Although Brienz is one of the smallest of Swiss lakes, it can well claim to be one of the most beautiful. One of its chief beauties is the Geissbach fall, which from a height of thousands of feet leaps in seven falls into the lake at its feet.","popularity":0,"poster_path":null,"production_companies":[{"id":44771,"logo_path":"/bfyrVfFnmmcanicDhqD9PNxbUHw.png","name":"Charles Urban Trading Company","origin_country":"GB"}],"production_countries":[{"iso_3166_1":"GB","name":"United Kingdom"}],"release_date":"1903-01-01","revenue":0,"runtime":0,"softcore":false,"spoken_languages":[{"english_name":"No Language","iso_639_1":"xx","name":"No Language"}],"status":"Released","tagline":"","title":"Lake Brienze and Geissbach Falls","video":false,"vote_average":0,"vote_count":0,"alternative_titles":{"titles":[]},"credits":{"cast":[],"crew":[{"adult":false,"gender":2,"id":3420885,"known_for_department":"Directing","name":"Frank Ormiston-Smith","original_name":"Frank Ormiston-Smith","popularity":0.3835,"profile_path":null,"credit_id":"6a910649a23a0dc4c5c27f5d","department":"Crew","job":"Cinematography"}]},"images":{"backdrops":[],"logos":[],"posters":[]},"external_ids":{"imdb_id":"tt2042586","wikidata_id":null,"facebook_id":null,"instagram_id":null,"twitter_id":null},"keywords":{"keywords":[{"id":1889,"name":"lake"},{"id":1223,"name":"swi